  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I have been using the Valve Index Controllers for days, but then I found the fingers are not tracking as good as other games that support it ( Take Alyx as an example) . The tracking never goes with other games and it tracks way better, so I dont think it's an hardware issue there. \nIt's easy to replicate, especially the left hand basically the animation will cut off when you trying to close them slowly while the right hand is fine. It happens on any avatar. \nPlease vote up if you see this issues. Thanks",
